Hi fellow builders!

We have some really cool news for you, today we launched the page for the new "Diorama Builder" DLC, a new diorama in space, the...

https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/35020302/a946f1c5dfca6a4f05c41d67d2682cd8230bbc30.png

In this new DLC, the player will come across a real exploration colony on Mars. In this diorama, the player will set up:

 Workshop for vehicles,;
 Greenhouse for growing plants;
 Rocket with its launch tower;
 Exploration truck;
 Power station;
 Control tower;
 And much more!

Click on the link below to find out more about the DLC and don't forget to add it to your WISHLIST to be notified when it is released.

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2777590/Diorama_Builder__Mars_Colony/

For those who have been off the planet this last month, we want to let you know that we also have two more DLCs already released:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2668590/Diorama_Builder__Medieval_Castle/

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2777580/Diorama_Builder__Noir_City/

Thank you very much for being part of the VIRTUAL ARTS STUDIO and DIORAMA BUILDER community!

And to not miss the news, follow our Steam developers page:
https://store.steampowered.com/developer/virtualartsstudio

https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/35020302/dcf99627ff2c4d336987c3088042afd9d1a74dce.png

Hi friends...

We are updating DIORAMA BUILDER with a new theme, "MERRY CHRISTMAS", in order to gift you at the end of 2020 and also to thank you for the support and feedbacks in our community.

And as we are listening to you there in the Community Hub, we have also included some of your suggestions for improvements and fixed some bugs, which we list below:


 Inclusion the PAN Camera control movement using the Keyboard (W, A, S, D keys);
 Changing the Mesh Display Keys from "A" and "S" to "Q" and "E";
 Inclusion the MESH color change system between "Black" and "White" using the "C" key;
 Inclusion the use of the "Z" and "X" Keys to control the camera's ZOOM;
 Implementation of the use of Steam Cloud;
 Correction of the problem that did not allow the recording of the game language when it was changed;
 Minor bugs fixes.


We want to give our players the best experience, so we will always be creating new themes and updating the game with improvements and new features.

Continue participating in our Community Hub and giving your suggestions for new themes and improvements for DIORAMA BUILDER!

Follow the Steam page of our studio to receive all the news about our games!
Go to https://store.steampowered.com/developer/virtualartsstudio and click on the FOLLOW button!
